          <attvalue for="35" value="0.9" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalation in US–Iran military and diplomatic confrontation raises the likelihood of strikes, seizures, or chokepoint disruptions (e.g., Strait of Hormuz, tanker attacks) that directly increase the probability of interrupted oil flows." />
