          <attvalue for="33" value="+" />
          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.72" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalation and sustainment of the Russia–Ukraine war raises global great‑power friction and diverts Western diplomatic/military focus and resources, creating openings and permissive signalling that enable Iran to escalate actions against US partners, increasing US–Iran conflict intensity." />
