          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter export controls and investment screening tied to the US–China tech rivalry prompt investors and funds to reduce exposure to targeted tech assets and reallocate capital into defense, energy and commodities sectors, increasing the observed rate of cross‑sector capital rotation relevant to the Russia–Ukraine war." />
