          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher available power generation and transmission capacity reduces the probability of supply interruptions and electricity price spikes that propagate into earnings shocks and repricing events, thereby lowering financial‑market volatility; conversely capacity shortfalls raise volatility." />
