          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An uptick in systemic geopolitical tension raises the likelihood of escalatory signalling, miscalculation, and force-posturing between the U.S. and Iran, increasing the intensity and frequency of kinetic and diplomatic confrontations in the US–Iran theater." />
