          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising perceived risk of oil disruptions incentivizes states and strategic actors to take protective or coercive measures (diplomatic pressure, naval deployments, sanctions/embargoes), increasing interstate and regional tensions that can escalate existing conflicts." />
