          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.9" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher oil-supply disruption risk drives sharp oil-price moves and sudden macro growth/inflation repricing, which directly increases short-term volatility across equity, FX and commodity markets." />
