          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Elevated oil-supply risk produces a risk-off environment and higher hedging costs that prompt portfolio outflows from emerging or exposed markets and slow cross-border M&amp;A and FDI between the US and China." />
